</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00435/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个蓝色四指环型握力器，其上用白色油漆印有“劣质产品® ”字样，当有人员把四根手指都伸入指环时，指环的半径将缩小10~26%，该异常影响通常持续时间从5分钟到█小时不等，期间该物品无法被以任何方式破坏<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/10/5<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-82训练区域健身区C2号器材架<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>于Site-CN-82异常物品仓库中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>“喂喂喂你这样是拔不出来的！”——Dr.Gaster，选自事故记录-H0714</em><br />
<em>“哼！啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！”Dr.Cerberus，选自事故记录-H0714</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00435" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00435" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00435-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaster-master" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3398699); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3398699&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609943627" alt="Gaster Master" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3398699)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaster-master" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3398699); return false;">Gaster Master</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602080060 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 Oct 2020 14:14</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00299/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把表面染有不可清除的不知名血迹的9mm伯莱塔92手枪。任何人类个体持有该项目后会出现一段幻觉，具体表现为被最信任的伙伴射杀并听到一句小声的对不起。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>[数据删除]的尸体旁<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放在Site-██低价值储物室的保险柜内<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>这可能……又是一段无奈的故事吧。——Dr.Liu</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00299" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00299" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00299-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6606914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609943627" alt="kaster-k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6606914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;">kaster-k</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1593913228 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">05 Jul 2020 01:40</span></p>
</div>
